2 CONT The Arab historian, ibn Hayyan names "Musa et son allie Garsiya, (Garcia), ibn Wannaqo Emir des Gascons, (d' Autres dissent que son aalie etait Furtun, (Fortun), - ibn Wannaqo, son frere Uterin"
2 CONT Musa ibn Musa al Qasawi fut aide pason frere uterin le chef de Pamplune - , ibn Wannaqo Married after 788 as her second husband - widow of Musa ibn Fortun head of the Banu Qasi family daughter of?
