1 NOTE {geni:about_me} RAYMONDE, daughter of --- (-[before 15 Jun 911]).  A charter dated 15 Jun 911, under which Arnust Archibishop of Narbonne donated property to Saint-Paul de Narbonne, names "infantes Majolo vicecomite et uxori suæ R
2 CONC aymundæ...Walchario et...Albericho vicecomite", the wording implying that the parents were deceased at that date[562].  Settipani suggests that she was the daughter of Raymond I Comte de Toulouse[563].  
