2 CONT Parents and Siblings (edit) F.  Ermengol of Rouergue M.  Adelaede Adelaide Rouerge Richilde de Rouergue Etienne , Count de Gevaudan I Adelaede de Rouergue Raymond II of Rouergue Spouse and Children (edit) H.  Raymond II of Rouergu
