2 CONT
2 CONT ↑ " Leon Royal Pantheon . "Nobility: the journal of genealogy, nobility and arms (Madrid) (2): pp. 346 and 349. July-September . Retrieved on June 2, 2010.
2 CONT
2 CONT ↑ " Foundation for Medieval Genealogy "(2000). Retrieved on February 20, 2010.
2 CONT
