1 NOTE The Monk of Leon. Had a very fickle personality.
2 CONT First he andicates and gives the throne to his brother Ramiro.
2 CONT He retires to a monestary of Salragun.
2 CONT Then he comes out of retirement to take up arms against his brother Ramiro.
2 CONT He had joined up with Fruela's sons, Ordono and Ramiro against his own brother.
2 CONT In any case, he was defeated and then blinded and sent back to the cloister of Salragun where he died.
