2 CONT Sancho II Garcés Abarca (after 935 – December 994) was King of Pamplona from 970 until his death. He was the son of García Sánchez I and Andregota, daughter of Galindo Aznárez II, Count of Aragon. After his succession, he recognis
2 CONC ed his younger brother Ramiro as King of Viguera.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sancho married Urraca, the daughter of the Castilian count Fernán González and Sancha of Navarre, Sancho's aunt. The marriage occurred after 962 and before 970. Before 950, Urraca had been married twice previously, to Ordoño III a
2 CONC nd Ordoño IV of León, from both of whom she separated. Sancho was her third and last husband. Their children were:
