1 NOTE {geni:about_me} LEDGARDE ([950/53]-after 16 Apr 980).  Comte Borrell donated property to the monastery of San Saturnino de Urgell, for the souls of "…uxoris meæ Letgarda vel prolis meæ, que de me et illa procreata est, et…fratris 
2 CONC mei Mironis comitis atque marchionis", by charter dated 6 Jun 969[285].  
2 CONT
2 CONT Her birth date is estimated on the assumption that she was 15 years or younger at the time of her marriage, but old enough to have given birth to her first child before the date of this charter.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Bofarull records a suggestion by Baluze that Ledgarde was the daughter of "Ramon Pons y Garsinda condes de Auvernia"[286].  The original work in which this suggestion is made has not yet been consulted.  However, without knowing t
2 CONC he basis on which the connection with the family of the Comtes de Toulouse is made, it is chronological impossible for Ledgarde to have been the daughter of Raymond Pons Comte de Toulouse et d´Auvergne whose children must have bee
2 CONC n born in the range [920/30].  If Ledgarde did belong to the Toulouse family, she must have been the daughter of Raymond III Comte de Toulouse, whose children would have been born in the range [940/60].  
2 CONT
2 CONT "Borrellus…chomes et marchio" sold property to "Unicfredo que vocant Amado" by charter dated 11 Jun 977, subscribed by "Ledgardis comitissa, Ansulfo, Vuitardus vicescomes…"[287].  "Borrellus comes et marchio et uxori mee Ledegards
2 CONC " donated property "in comitatu Ausona" to Vic by charter dated 16 Apr 980[288].  
2 CONT
2 CONT m (968 or before) as his first wife, BORRELL [II] Comte de Barcelona, son of SUNYER [I] Comte de Barcelona & his wife Richilde --- (-30 Sep 993).]  
2 CONT
2 CONT http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/TOULOUSE.htm
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Raymond III, Count of Toulouse and Adelaide had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Raymond (IV or V)
2 CONT
2 CONT Hugues (Hugh)
2 CONT
2 CONT Letgarda, who married Borrel II of Barcelona.
2 CONT
2 CONT Borrell II, Count of Barcelona
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Letgarda, daughter of Raymond III of Toulouse, with whom he had two sons and two daughters: Ramon Borrell, Ermengol, Ermengarda and Richilda. After his wife's death he married again Eimeruda of Auvergne.
