2 CONC ough highlighting that the hypothesis is uncertain[983].  In addition, her absence from the 961 will of her supposed father, Raymond I Comte de Rouergue, suggests that the hypothesis is incorrect.  m as his first wife, '''GAUSFRED
2 CONC O Conde de Ampurias y Rosellón,''' son of GAUSBERTO I Conde de Ampurias y Rosellón & his wife Trudegarda ---.  991.]
