1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ====Medlands does not include a Gudinilda as dau. of [https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/CATALAN%20NOBILITY.htm#SunyerIBarcelonadied950B Sunyer I de Barcelona]:
2 CONT * SUNYER [I] de Barcelona, son of GUIFRÉ [I] "el Velloso/el Pilós/the Hairy" Comte de Barcelona & his wife Guinidilda --- (-15 Oct 954, bur Ripoll Monastery)....'''m''' (917 or before) '''RICHILDE''', daughter of --- (-after 954).
2 CONC ...Szabolcs de Vajay suggests[188] that she was Richilde de Rouergue, daughter of Ermengaud de Toulouse Comte de Rouergue & his wife Adelais ---, to explain the transmission of the name Armengol [Ermengaud] into the Barcelona fami
