1 NOTE {geni:about_me} PLEASE NOTE: Sunyer I and Sunifred II were not the same person: they were apparently brothers, sons of Guifre/Wilfred the Hairy. See profile for Sunyer I: http://www.geni.com/profile/index/6000000001744871756
