1 NOTE {geni:about_me} -https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Guillaume_d%27Astarac
2 CONT
2 CONT William I (died after 1060) was the Count of Astarac from 1022 or 1023. He was, according to the Genealogica Comitum Guasconiæ, the eldest son of Arnold II of Astarac and Talesa. On his father's death he received Astarac while his
2 CONC  younger brother Bernard Pelagus received Pardiac. .. ..
