2 CONT She was the daughter of Count Menendo González of the First County of Portugal and corregente of León, descendant of the highest nobility of Portugal and Galicia, she married Alfonso V of León (before 1010). She was the mother of 
2 CONC King Bermudo III of León.
2 CONT
