2 CONT   Fernando I King Of Castile And Leon (1017 - 1065)
2 CONT
2 CONT  Children:
2 CONT   Urraca Of Zamora (1034 - 1101)*
2 CONT   Sancho II King Of Castile (1036 - 1072)*
2 CONT   Elvira De Toro (1039 - 1101)*
2 CONT   Alfonso VI King Of Castile And Leon (1039 - 1109)*
2 CONT   Garcia De Galicia (1042 - 1090)*
2 CONT
2 CONT  Sibling:
2 CONT   Sancha de León (1013 - 1067)
2 CONT   Bermudo De Leon (1017 - 1037)*
