2 CONT Urraca of Navarre, was the fourth daughter of García Sánchez II of Navarre "The Temblón" (circa 964 - 999), and Jimena Fernandez (died after 1035), daughter of Count Ferdinand Vermúdez and Elvira.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married in 1023 to Alfonso V of León, with whom she had the Infanta Jimena of León, grandmother of the wife of El Cid Doña Jimena Diaz.
