2 CONT MARRIAGE: Marriage Information: Ermentrude married Count Alberic MACON, II, son of Marquis Adalbert IVREA and Countess Gerberge BURGUNDY. (Count Alberic MACON, II was born about 948-958 in Macon, Seine-Et-Loire, France and died be
2 CONC fore 5 Mar 1005.) Marriage Information: Ermentrude also married King Otto William LOMBARD, son of Marquis Adalbert IVREA and Countess Gerberge BURGUNDY, on 16 Jan 965. (King Otto William LOMBARD was born about 4 Sep 945-974 and di
2 CONC ed on 21 Sep 1026-1027.)	
