1 NOTE 859747676. Kong Sancho IV RAMIROSON av Aragon was born in 1045.(20035) He was a Konge in 1067 in Aragon.(20036) He was a Konge in 1076 in Navarra.(20037) He died in Jun 1094.(20038) He was married to Felicitas HILDUINSDTR av Roucy
2 CONC  in 1063.
