2 CONT
2 CONT ~ 755 child birth: Andorre = Urgel-Cerdagne, ♂ # Belló IV of Carcassonne (Cerdagne, de Bello-Gallo, Ausona, Razès) [Razès] b. ~ 755 d. < 812?
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes
2 CONT
2 CONT Not to be confused with William Fierabrace (Bras-de-Fer) (Vichard, b. 1010? d. 1046) or William Fierabrace (Toulouse et Gellone) (Toulouse, b. 755 d. 28 March 812)
2 CONT
2 CONT It is not clear that this person is the same as William Fierabrace of Gellone who allied himself with Franks against the Muslims. Fireabrace would hardly have been welcome in Muslim Cordoba nor supported by the Umayyids against th
2 CONC e Muslims.
2 CONT
