2 CONC  Alfonso I, and brother of King Aurelius.
2 CONT
2 CONT The rest of his reign saw Moorish raids into Álava and Galicia. He was defeated badly at Bierzo and abdicated the throne in 791, returning to his frock. Nevertheless, he was considered a generous and illustrious man in his time.
