2 CONT [edit] Administration of the realm and the granting of fueros
2 CONT
2 CONT Late and fanciful painting of Peter I. The hand on the sword is an accurate pictorial comment on his reign.During his reign Peter bestowed fueros on Barbastro (1100), Caparroso (1102), and Santacara (1102). The last was repopulate
