2 CONC 1085. He married his daughters, Urraca, Teresa and Elvira to French princes, and in every way forwarded the spread of French influence — then the greatest civilizing force in Europe. He also drew Spain nearer to the Papacy. It was
2 CONC  Alfonso's decision which established the Roman ritual in place of the old missal of Saint Isidore — the Mozarabic rite.
