1 NAME Tetberga "Geriberga" /de Provenza/ comtessa consort d'Urgell
2 GIVN Tetberga "Geriberga"
2 NSFX comtessa consort d'Urgell
2 _MARNM de Provenza
2 NICK Gerberga
2 NICK Teutberga
2 NICK Tetberga
1 NAME Thetberge "Geriberga" /de Provenza/
2 GIVN Thetberge "Geriberga"
2 SURN de Provenza
1 SEX F
1 DEAT
2 DATE BET 1010 AND 1017
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} -https://ca.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tedberga_de_Gavald%C3%A0<br/>
2 CONT ...It has been claimed that on his death, Ermengol married Geriberga, also called Guisla, a woman of unknown origin. However, some authors have identified Geriberga with Tedberga herself, [1] who would have survived her husband, a
2 CONC s seen in the cathedral constitution of Urgell, where only she and her son are present. [5]
2 CONT ------
2 CONT
2 CONT  From MedLands:
2 CONT
2 CONT ARMENGOL [I] de Barcelona, "él de Córdoba", son of BORRELL [II] Comte de Barcelona & his first wife Ledgarda [de Toulouse] ([973/77]-Córdoba 1 Sep 1010, bur Ripoll).  “Borellus…comes et marchio…filios meos Raymundo et Ermengode” o
2 CONC rdered the security of “castro…Cardona”, constructed by “avus meus Wifredus comes et marchio”, by charter dated 9 Apr 986, subscribed by “Geribertus vicecomes…Gocefridus frater Borelli comes”[1885].  "Arnaldo, Ermengaudo prolem Bo
2 CONC rrellum comes…" subscribed a charter dated 26 Sep 989 under which "Borrello…comes atque marchio" sold property to Sant Cugat del Vallés[1886].  He succeeded his father in 992 as Comte de Urgell.  The testament of "Borellus comes" 
2 CONC dated 24 Sep 993 appoints "filio meo Ermengaudo comite" to "comitatu Orgullense"[1887].  The Chronicle of Adémar de Chabannes records that "Ermengaudus comes Irgeldensis" was killed in battle against the Muslims and that his head 
2 CONC was taken away by the victors[1888].  "Ermengaudus…comes et marchio" donated revenue from Andorra to the monastery of San Cerni by charter dated 13 Jun 1007[1889].  The testament of “Ermengaudus...comes et marchio”, dated 28 Jul 1
2 CONC 010, appointed “...Guillelmus vicecomes” among his executors, and made bequests to religious houses[1890].  The Chronicon alterum Rivipullense records the death in 1010 of “Ermengaudus comes Urgelli”[1891]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT m (before 11 Jun 1001) '''GERIBERGA''', daughter of --- (-[before 1017]).  Armengol and his wife "Geriberga" sold property to a vassal by charter dated 11 Jun 1101[1892].  Her origin is not known.  She is shown in Europäische Stam
2 CONC mtafeln[1893] as '''Tetberga''', (presumably on the basis that "Geriberga" is a mistranscription in the document cited above) [daughter of Rotbold [II] Comte de Provence & his wife Eimilde de Gevaudan], but the basis for this spec
2 CONC ulative parentage is not known.  The date of her death is not known.  However, the charter dated 22 Apr 1037 (quoted below) suggests that Ramon Borrell Comte de Barcelona (who died in 1017) acted as comte d´Urgell at some stage du
2 CONC ring the minority of her son Comte Armengoll [II].  If that is correct, it is likely that Geriberga died before 1017. 
2 CONT
2 CONT * http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/CATALAN%20NOBILITY.htm#_Toc496858604
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT -http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/PROVENCE.htm#TetbergaMArmengolIUrgeldied1010<br/>
2 CONT d)        ''' [''' '''TETBERGA''' (-after 1010).  Armengol and his wife "'''Geriberga'''" sold property to a vassal by charter dated 11 Jun 1101[208].  Her origin is not known.  She is shown in Europäische Stammtafeln[209] as '''T
2 CONC etberga''', (presumably on the basis that "'''Geriberga'''" is a mistranscription in the document cited above) '''['''daughter of Rotbold [II] Comte de Provence & his wife Eimilde de Gevaudan''']''', but the basis for this specula
2 CONC tion is not known.  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' (before 11 Jun 1001) ARMENGOL [I] "él de Córdoba" Comte de Urgell, son of BORELL [II] Comte de Barcelona & his first wife Ledgarda [de Toulouse] ([975]-Córdoba 1 Sep 1010).''']''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----------
2 CONT
2 CONT  PLZ source or calculations for birth date 985
2 CONT [reported conflicts with the daughter's date 992, even those that are unsourced & removed] 
2 CONT
2 CONT -------
