1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Lope FERRENCH
2 CONT Sosa : 1,017,679,616
2 CONT Deceased
2 CONT Caballero aragonés
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents
2 CONT sosa Fernando (Ferrench) de PAMPLONA †1068
2 CONT sosa Nuña IÑIGUEZ †
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouses and children
2 CONT Married to sosa Ximena MARTINEZ † with
2 CONT M sosa Bacalla de LUNA †1115
