1 OCCU King of Cantabria, Duke of Bartulio, Herdeiro no Ducado de Cantábria, por disposição e vontade de seu pai., Duke of Cantabria
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Fruela''' (c695-757), Duke of Cantabria, and Count of Bartulio. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Fruela de Cantabria or Fruela Pérez was the second son of Pedro Duke of Cantabria and brother of  Alfonso I King of Asturias. His sons Aurelio and Bermudo were both kings of Asturias. A daugther is attributed to him, called Numabe
2 CONC la, who married with Lupo II Duke of Gascony. 
2 CONT
2 CONT According to the chronicles of Afonso III, he battled with King Pelayo and his brother King  Alfonso I in the military campaigns made during their reigns.
2 CONT
2 CONT Not to be confused with King Fruela I of Asturias.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
