2 CONT '''Isabel''' ('''Elisabeth'''), wife of [http://www.geni.com/people/Alfonso-VI-el-Bravo-rey-de-Le%C3%B3n-y-de-Castilla/6000000000665380375 Alfonso VI]. She was the mother of Sancho 1093, Elvira 1100 and Sancha 1104. Her 4th pregna
2 CONC ncy September 1107 caused complications which killed her and the child. Same like Fatima ibn Muhammad.
2 CONT
2 CONT Her burial plaque being named "Isabel" originally Zaida, erected long after her death, others have called her daughter of Louis of France, which is chronologically impossible. As there is proof of Sancho, Elvira marriage to king R
2 CONC oger ii of Sicily, and Sancha's downline which leads to England, Scotland, & USA. Furthermore, Elvira marriage to king Roger ii was political motivated as Muslim growth in area of Sicily (Italy) and which counts Roger II loved his
2 CONC  wife. 
