2 CONT "GIL Vásquez de Soverosa, son of VASCO Fernández de Soverosa & his wife Teresa Gonçales de Sousa (-before 1222, bur Pombeiro). The Nobiliario of Pedro Conde de Barcelos names "D. Gil Vazquez de Soverosa, D. Martin, D. Elvira Vazqu
2 CONC ez, D. Aldara Vazquez" as the children of "D. Vasco Fernandez" and his wife "D. Teresa Gonçalez de Sousa", adding that Gil was buried "en Pombero"[2645].
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT (...) m thirdly as her first husband, MARÍA González Girón, daughter of GONZALO Rodríguez Girón & his first wife Sancha Rodríguez. The Nobiliario of Pedro Conde de Barcelos records that "D. Gil Vazquez de Soverosa" married thirdly
2 CONC  "D. Maria Gonçalez Giron"[2649]. She married secondly (before 8 May 1222) Guillén Pérez de Guzmán Señor de Vecilla. "Don Gonzalo Roiz maiordomo del rei de Castella e mios fiios et fiias que oue de donna Sancha Roiz…a saber don Ro
2 CONC drigo Gonzaluez et Theresa Gonzaluez con otorgamiento de so marido, Roi Gonzaluez, et Maria Gonzaluez con otorgamiento de so marido, Guillem Pedrez e Aldonza Gonzaluez con otorgamiento de so marido, Ramiro Frolez et Eluira Gonzalu
2 CONC ez con otorgamiento de la abbadessa e del conuento de Sancta Maria la Real de Burgos, e Sancha Gonzaluez con otorgamiento de la abbadessa e del conuento de Sant Andres de Arroio, e Brigida Gonzaluez con otorgamiento de la abbadess
2 CONC a e del conuento de Perales…" ratified donations to the bishopric of Palencia by charter dated 8 May 1222[2650]."
