2 CONT
2 CONT by Usurpation 	Countess of Toulouse
2 CONT
2 CONT 1094 disinherited,
2 CONT
2 CONT reclaimed 1098-1105 	Succeeded by:
2 CONT
2 CONT Bertrand,
2 CONT
2 CONT by sale
