2 CONC z, Enego Veillaz, Piniolo Eximeniz, Vellasco Alemeiuze, Vermudo Cidiz". “...Pelagio Frolaz armiger...Peitro Frogilaz...Scemeno Frogilaz...” confirmed the charter dated 18 May 1019 under which Alfonso V King of León granted "vilas.
