1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The PEDIGREE of Garcia Ordonez (Seigneur) de VILLAMAYOR
2 CONT
2 CONT Lady Diana's 29-Great Grandfather.       Louis XVII's 23-Great Grandfather.       HM Juan Carlos' 28-Great Grandfather.       Philippe of Belgium's 21-Great Grandfather.       HM Manuel II's 20-Great Grandfather.       Grand Duke 
2 CONC Henri's 20-Great Grandfather.  "There is no king who has not had a slave among his ancestors, and no slave who has not had a king among his."   
2 CONT >> Good quote from Helen Keller - Garcia Ordonez Lord of VILLAMAYOR is my 21st great grandfather, King Richard the Lionhearted, my 27th great grandfather, and so on....(once you're in the family .. well, they all intermarried!)  -
2 CONC cggpd <<<<
2 CONT --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT  Wife/Partner:       Maria Lopez de ALMENARA 
2 CONT  Children:       Elvira Garcia de VILLAMAYOR   ;   Fernan Garcia de VILLAMAYOR   ;   Ruy Garcia de VILLAMAYOR 
2 CONT --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
