2 CONT Agnes of Aquitaine, Queen of Aragon
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Agnes of Aquitaine was a daughter of Duke William IX of Aquitaine.
2 CONT
2 CONT She first married Aimery V of Thouars. In her second marriage, she bore Petronila of Aragon, the daughter and heiress of Ramiro II of Aragon.
2 CONT
2 CONT Matilda (Agnes) de POITOU
2 CONT
2 CONT    aka Agnes (Maud) d' AQUITAINE
2 CONT
2 CONT Born:  abt. 1097    Died:  abt. 1156 
2 CONT
2 CONT HM George I's 15-Great Grandmother.       Lady Diana's 24-Great Grandmother.       PM Churchill's 24-Great Grandmother.       Geo Washington's 19-Great Grandmother.       Louis XVII's 18-Great Grandmother.       Poss. my 26-Great 
2 CONC Grandmother.
2 CONT
2 CONT Husbands/Partners:         Ramiro II SANCHEZ (King) of ARAGON   ;   Aimery VI (V) de THOUARS 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:         Petronilla RAMIREZ (Queen) of ARAGON   ;   Geoffroy V de THOUARS   ;   Marguerite de THOUARS
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Agnes of Aquitaine was a daughter of Duke William IX of Aquitaine.
2 CONT
2 CONT She first married Aimery V of Thouars. In her second marriage, she bore Petronila of Aragon, the daughter and heiress of Ramiro II of Aragon.
