2 CONT
2 CONT Agnes of Aquitaine, the daughter of Duke William IX of Aquitaine, first married Aimery V of Thouars. In her second marriage, to our ancestor King Ramiro II of Aragon, she bore Petronila of Aragon.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
