2 CONC II, 1126–1157 (University of Pennsylvania Press, 1998), 61. Jump up ^ Reilly, The Kingdom of León-Castilla Under King Alfonso VII, 109. Jump up ^ Reilly, The Kingdom of León-Castilla Under King Alfonso VII, 118. Jump up ^ T. N. Bi
