1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Original name '''Wa'il bin Umayyah'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Abu al-As ibn Umayya:
2 CONT His sons were the following:
2 CONT Affan, father of Caliph Uthman.
2 CONT Al-Hakam, the father of the Umayyad caliph Marwan I.
2 CONT Al-Mughira, maternal great-grandfather of the Umayyad caliph Abd al-Malik ibn Marwan.
2 CONT He also had daughters:
2 CONT Safiyya, who married Abu Sufyan.
2 CONT Their daughter Ramla was a wife of Muhammad.
2 CONT Arwa, who married Amr ibn Hisham. Their daughter Asma was the second wife of Caliph Uthman.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abu_al-%27As_ibn_Umayyah
