2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Affan ibn Abi al-As is the ancestor of a Sahaba.
2 CONT
2 CONT His father was Abu al-A'as ibn Umayya. He had two brother's, al-Hakam ibn Abi al-'As and Uthman ibn Abi al-'As. His son was Uthman ibn Affan. His nephew was Marwan ibn al-Hakam, His sister was Safiyya bint Abi al-'As, the mother o
2 CONC f a wife of Muhammad, Ramlah bint Abu Sufyan.
2 CONT
