2 CONC ww.geni.com/people/Liubigotona-Visigoth-queen-consort/6000000012137982291?through=6000000012137915513 Liubigotona] the Visigoth, daughter of [https://www.geni.com/people/Suintila-rey-de-los-visigodos/6000000004285169194?through=60
2 CONC 00000012137982291 Suíntila] King of the Visigoths, but the primary source on which this is based has not yet been identified.
2 CONT *** … 
