2 CONT ==Origins
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT GUTIERRE Menéndez, son of HERMENEGILDO Gutiérrez & his wife Ermesinda Gatóniz (-933).  "…Gutier Menendiz, Arias Menendiz, Flaginus Didaz…" … Conde, he governed six counties in Galicia granted to him by Alfonso IV King of León[352]
2 CONC . … 
2 CONT ''m'' ILDUARA Eriz, daughter of ERO Fernández & his first wife Adosinda --- (-958). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Gutierre Menéndez & his wife had five children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.     '''    MUNIO Gutiérrez ''' (-[959/60]).  Conde 911-955.  He took part in the delimitation of the territories of Braga and Dume for Alfonso III "el Magno" King of León in 911[359].  … 
2 CONT '''m''' his first cousin, ELVIRA Arias, daughter of conde ARIAS Menéndez & his wife Ermesinda Gundesíndiz (-after 11 Jun 962).  
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/Galicia.htm#MunioGutierrezdied959
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.      '''   MUNIO Gutiérrez ''' (-[959/60]).  Conde 911-955. … m his first cousin, ELVIRA Arias, daughter of conde ARIAS Menéndez & his wife Ermesinda Gundesíndiz (-after 11 Jun 962).  
2 CONT
2 CONT Munio & his wife had six children: 
2 CONT * a)         GUTIERRE Muñoz (-[999]). … m ---.  The name of Gutierre's wife is not known.
2 CONT
2 CONT * b)         ARIAS Muñoz (-973). Conde.  … Bishop of Dumio 948/956
2 CONT * c)         GOTO Muñoz (-after 1 Mar 963).  … m (before 927) SANCHO Ordóñez, son of ORDOÑO II King of León & his first wife Elvira Menéndez ([890/93] or later-929). 
2 CONT * d)         ERMESINDA Muñoz (-after 962). 
2 CONT * e)         ELVIRA Muñoz (-after 986). 
2 CONT * f)          GONZALO Muñoz (-[982/84]). … m his first cousin, MUNIADOMNA Fróilaz, daughter of conde FRUELA Gutiérrez & his wife Sarracina ---.  
