2 CONC ated property to Burgos cathedral by charter dated 14 Aug 1164[1048]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT g)             doña ERMENGARDA Manrique .  “Ermessenda comitissa…quondam uxor Almarrici comitis…cum filiis meis…domno Amelrico et domno Petro atque Guillelmo et domna Maria et domna Sancia et domna Ermengard” donated property to B
