2 CONC Castroxeriz, and ao The clear opinion of King Don Garcia of Galicia, who denaturalized himself from Castela and naturalized in Galicia, and who would aspire to rebuild on our earth all the power and influence of the Trava, of the 
2 CONC family of his wife."
