2 CONT
2 CONT [ETIENNE de Courtenay (-1101).  Etienne is shown as the son of Joscelin [I] and his first wife in Burke´s Peerage but the primary source on which this is based has not yet been identified.   The Historia of Monk Aimon records the 
2 CONC mother of Guy and Renard de Joigny as the only child of Joscelin by his first wife, which suggests that Etienne must have been born from his father´s second marriage, although the same source does not name Etienne as one of Joscel
2 CONC in´s sons by his second marriage.  m HERSENT de Montereau, daughter of ---.  This marriage is shown in Burke´s Peerage but the primary source on which it is based has not yet been identified.]   Etienne & his wife had one child, A
2 CONC dam de Chailly.
