2 CONC ouses living. He was so enamoured of Bertrade that he refused to leave her even when threatened with excommunication. Pope Urban II did excommunicate him in 1095, and Philip was prevented from taking part in the First Crusade. Ast
2 CONC onishingly, Bertrade persuaded Philip and Fulk to be friends.
