2 CONT Bertrade de Montfort, comtessa d' Anjou was born in 1060.3 She was the daughter of Simon I, seigneur de Montfort and Agnes d' Évereux.1,2 Bertrade de Montfort, comtessa d' Anjou married Foulques IV "le Rechin", comte d' Anjou, son
2 CONC  of Geoffroy II "Ferreol", comte de Gâtinais and Ermengarde d'Anjou, in 1089; His 4th. Her 1st.4,5,3,6,1 Bertrade de Montfort, comtessa d' Anjou and Foulques IV "le Rechin", comte d' Anjou were divorced on 15 April 1092.6 Bertrade
2 CONC  de Montfort, comtessa d' Anjou deserted her husband Fulk for Philip I of France.1 She married Philippe I "Amorons", roi des Francs, son of Henri I, roi des Francs and Anna Yaroslavna, on 15 May 1092; His 2nd. Her 2nd.6,4,1 Bertra
2 CONC de de Montfort, comtessa d' Anjou and Philippe I "Amorons", roi des Francs were divorced in 1104; Repudiated.5 Bertrade de Montfort, comtessa d' Anjou died on 14 February 1117 at Fontevrault-l'Abbaye, Maine-et-Loire, Pays de la Lo
2 CONC ire, France, at age 57 years. She died a nun.3,6 Family 1
