2 CONC œur de Guy II comte de Rochefort et de Hugues de Crécy"[318].  Vicomte de Château-Landon.  He witnessed a charter of Louis VII King of France dated Apr 1180 confirming a donation by Pierre de France Seigneur de Courtenay to the ab
2 CONC bey of Fontaine-Jean[319].  m ---.  The name of Guy’s wife is not known.  Guy [II] & his wife had [one] child: 
