2 CONC modis, the daughter of count Aldebert II of La Marche. They have only one son, William V (VI). After the death of his first wife, Wulgrin remarried to Amable de Châtellerault and have three children: Fulk, Geoffrey "Martel" and an
2 CONC  unnamed daughter.
