1 NOTE Guillaume X Duke Of was born in 1099 in , , Aquitaine.  Guillaume X Duke Of's father was Guillaume VII (IX) Duke Of AQUITAINE and his mother was Philippa (Mathilde Or Maude), Countess Of TOULOUSE.  His paternal grandparents were G
2 CONC uillaume VIII (Guy Geoffroy), Duke Of AQUITAINE and Hildegarde, Princess Of FRANCE; his maternal grandfather was Guillaume IV Count Of TOULOUSE and his maternal grandmother is Mathilde Countess Of TOULOUSE. He had three brothers a
2 CONC nd three sisters, named Raymond D', Guillaume I Of, Henri D', Agnaes (Maud) Princess Of, Adbelahide D' and Agnaes D'.  He died at the age of 38 on April 19th, 1137 in , , , France   from goole
