2 CONC also the counties of Cerdanya and Roussillon (inherited in 1172). Béarn and Bigorre paid homage to him in 1187. Alfonso's involvement in the affairs of Languedoc proved highly beneficial, strengthening Aragonese trade and stimulat
2 CONC ing emigration from the north to colonise the newly reconquered lands in Aragón.
