2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/TOULOUSE%20NOBILITY.htm#CeciliaM1151RogerBernardFoix
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.         RAYMOND "Trencavel" de Béziers (-murdered 15 Oct 1167).   ... m [firstly] ADELICIA, daughter of --- (-[28 Feb], after 21 Apr 1154).
2 CONT
2 CONT Raymond & his [first] wife had two children:
2 CONT
2 CONT b)         CECILE de Béziers (-after 4 Dec 1167).  ... 
2 CONT
2 CONT m ([1151]) ROGER BERNARD Comte de Foix, son of ROGER III Comte de Foix & his wife Jimena de Barcelona. 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/toulcofo.htm#RogerBernardIFoixdied1188A
2 CONT
2 CONT Comte Roger Bernard [I] & his wife had [five] children: 
2 CONT *a)         ROGER de Foix (before 1160-1182). 
2 CONT *b)         RAYMOND ROGER de Foix (-Château de Mirepoix 27 Mar 1223).  
2 CONT * c)         daughter .  The marriage contract between “Rogerius-Bernardi comes Fuxensis Essemenæ filius...filiam suam” and “Arnaldus-Bernardi de Marcafaba filius Gallardæ...Arnaldus-Bernardi...filium suum" is dated Dec 1162[264].
2 CONC   m (contract Dec 1162) ARNAUD GUILLAUME de Marquefave, son of ARNAUD BERNARD de Marquefave {Haute-Garonne} & his wife ---.
2 CONT * d)         ESCLARMONDE de Foix (-after 1215). m JOURDAIN [III] Seigneur de l'Isle-Jourdain, son of JOURDAIN [II] Seigneur de l'Isle-Jourdain {Gers} & his wife Escaronne de Terrides {near Labourgade, Tarn-et-Garonne} (-[Sep 1200/
2 CONC 1204]). 
2 CONT * e)         [daughter .  Her family origin is indicated by the Historia Albigensium of Pierre de Vaux-Cernay which records that [her son] "Rogerius de Comenge consanguineus comitis Fuxi" at first supported Simon de Montfort again
2 CONC st Raymond VI Comte de Toulouse[270].  Europäische Stammtafeln suggests that she was the daughter of Roger Bernard [I] Comte de Foix[271].  The primary source which confirms this relationship has not been identified.  m ROGER [I] 
2 CONC Vicomte de Couserans, son of BERNARD [III] Comte de Comminges & his wife --- de Toulouse (-before 3 Apr 1211).]
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT http://genealogiequebec.info/testphp/info.php?no=116651
