1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Mu'awiya ibn Hishâm al-Dimashqi'''
2 CONT
2 CONT b. 715, d. 736
2 CONT
2 CONT Father	Hishâm ibn 'Abd al-Malik, 10th Umayyad Caliph1,2 b. 690, d. 743
2 CONT
2 CONT Of the Marwanid. Mu`awiya ibn Hishâm al-Dimashqi was born in 715.1 He was the son of Hishâm ibn 'Abd al-Malik, 10th Umayyad Caliph.1,2 Mu`awiya ibn Hishâm al-Dimashqi married Raha the Berber before 731.1 Mu`awiya ibn Hishâm al-Dim
2 CONC ashqi died in 736 at age 21 years.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Family
2 CONT
2 CONT Raha the Berber b. circa 716
2 CONT
2 CONT Child	
2 CONT
2 CONT 'Abd al-Rahmân I al-Dâkhil ibn Mu'âwiya, amir al-Qurtubi+ b. 731, d. 7881,2
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT
2 CONT [S187] Royal Genealogy Database, online http://www.dcs.hull.ac.uk/public/genealogy/
2 CONT
2 CONT [S1411] Stanley Lane-Pool, The Mohammadan Dynasties, pg. 11.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mu%27awiya_ibn_Hisham
