2 CONT
2 CONT She married Zayd bin Haritha, and bore 2 children: Zayd & Ruqayya.
2 CONT After Zayd died, she married Zubayr bin al-Awwam and bore him Zaynab shortly after she divorced him.
2 CONT She then married Abdul-Rahman bin Awf and bore him: Ibrahim, Humayd, Muhammad, Ismail, Hamida, and Amatul-Rahman. After he died, she married Amr bin al-As and died in Egypt.
