2 CONT * Ervígio was an usurper of the Visigothic throne of Toledo who, in collusion with other nobles, betrayed King Vamba (672 - 686). Son of Ardabasto Baltes and Goda ; He was crowned and anointed on October 21 , 680 (680 - November 6
2 CONC 87). He persecuted the Jews having been helped in this by Bishop Julião de Toledo , himself a converted Jew. He married Liuvigoto who had Pedro, Duke of Cantabria.
2 CONT
