2 CONT He [Pedro] governed his own land for many years. His son followed in the steps of his father. For this reason he was enriched with honor in the flower of his youth and respected by the Emperor [Alfonso VII]. It was his rule to be 
2 CONC witness to the law and to be an evil plague to the Moors.
