2 CONT En mi nuevo libro LA SORPRENDENTE GENEALOGÍA DE MIS TATARABUELOS, encontrarán a este y muchos otros de sus ancestros con un resumen biográfico de cada uno. El libro está disponible en: amazon.com            barnesandnoble.com     
2 CONC         palibrio.com.  Les será de mucha utilidad y diversión.  Ramón Rionda
2 CONT
2 CONT In my new book LA SORPRENDENTE GENEALOGÍA DE MIS TATARABUELOS, you will find this and many other of your ancestors, with a biography summary of each of them. The book is now available at:  amazon.com            barnesandnoble.com 
2 CONC             palibrio.com.  Check it up, it’s worth it. Ramón Rionda
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/8067931/richilde_of_poland
2 CONT
2 CONT Polish Nobility. Born Duchess of Krakow and Silesia and related to the Hohenstaufen dynasty, she was the fourth-born daughter of Ladislav II and first cousin of Emperor Frederick Barbarossa. Richilde became consort queen of Castil
2 CONC e, having married Alphonse VII (1152), and in 1161 countess of Provence having contracted a second marriage with Raymond Berengario II. Upon the death of her second husband, she married for the third time with Count Albert of Ever
2 CONC stein.
2 CONT Bio by: Lucy & Chris
