2 CONC  Lady of Guadalajara Berengária, Queen of Denmark Mafalda, Queen of Castile Father 	Afonso I Mother 	Maud of Savoy Born 	11 November 1154(1154-11-11) Coimbra, Kingdom of Portugal Died 	26 March 1212[aged 57] Coimbra, Kingdom of Po
