2 CONT Ermengarde (Ermentrude) DU MAINE Countess Of Anjou 
2 CONT
2 CONT Born: Abt 1097, Flèche, Sarthe, Maine/Pays-de-la-Loire, France 
2 CONT Married: 11 Jul 1110, France 
2 CONT Died: 1126, Maine, Normandy, France
2 CONT
2 CONT Ancestral File Number: 9HPW-2K. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Events:
2 CONT 1. Alternate Birth; 1094, Mans, Maine, France. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Information:
2 CONT Ermengarde married Comte Foulques (Fulk) V "Le Jeune" D' ANJOU King of Jerusalem, son of Foulques (Fulk) IV "le Réchin" D' ANJOU Count of Anjou (1068-1109) and Bertrade (Bertrada, Béatrice) DE MONTFORT-L' AMAURY Queen of France, o
2 CONC n 11 Jul 1110 in France. The marriage ended in divorce. (Comte Foulques (Fulk) V "Le Jeune" D' ANJOU King of Jerusalem was born in 1092 in Anjou, France, died on 10 Nov 1143 in Jerusalem, Palestine and was buried in Church Of Holy
2 CONC  Sepulchre, Jerusalem, Israel.)
