2 CONT [edit] Children
2 CONT
2 CONT Geoffrey and Matilda's children were:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.Henry II of England (1133–1189) 2.Geoffrey, Count of Nantes (1 June 1134 Rouen- 26 July 1158 Nantes) died unmarried and was buried in Nantes 3.William X, Count of Poitou (1136–1164) died unmarried Geoffrey also had illegitimate 
2 CONC children by an unknown mistress (or mistresses): Hamelin; Emme, who married Dafydd Ab Owain Gwynedd, Prince of North Wales; and Mary, who became a nun and Abbess of Shaftesbury and who may be the poetess Marie de France. Adelaide 
2 CONC of Angers is sometimes sourced as being the mother of Hamelin.
