2 CONT A.      COMTES de ROCHEFORT (SEIGNEURS de MONTLHERY)
2 CONT
2 CONT GUY [II] "le Rouge" de Montlhéry, son of GUY [I] Seigneur de Montlhéry & his wife Hodierne de Gometz-la-Ferté (-1108). ... m firstly ELISABETH, daughter of ---.  ... m secondly (after [1071/80]) as her second husband, ADELAIS de C
2 CONC récy, widow of BOUCHARD [II] Comte de Corbeil, daughter of --- (-[24 Sep or 12 Oct] after 1104).  Guy [II] & his [first] wife had [three] children: 
2 CONT *1.         GUY [III] (-[19 Nov] [1115]).  Comte de Rochefort. 
2 CONT **a) ...
2 CONT *2.         [daughter . ... m ANSEAU de Garlande, son of GUILLAUME [I] Seigneur de Garlande & his wife Havoise --- (-1118).  Seneschal of France 1107/18.] 
2 CONT *3.         ['''BIOTE de Montlhéry''' .  Her parentage and marriage are confirmed only by a document written in 1630 which names "Fédéric vicomte de Gastinois, fils de Guy…fils d’un autre Guy…vicomte de Gastinois nay de Biote de R
2 CONC ochefort, sœur de Guy II comte de Rochefort et de Hugues de Crécy"[462].  If this is correct, the chronology suggests that she was born from her father’s first marriage.  m (before 1098) FOULQUES Vicomte de Château-Landon, son of 
2 CONC LETAUD [II] & his wife --- (-after 1122).] 
2 CONT
2 CONT Guy [II] & his second wife had three children: 
