2 CONC  Helvidis" by charter dated [1150][85].  same person as…?  ELVIDE (-1202 or after).  The primary source which confirms her marriage has not yet been identified.  m BARTHELEMY Seigneur de Vignory, son of GUY [V] de Vignory & his wi
2 CONC fe Tiphaine --- (-Acre 1190). 
