2 CONT *https://books.google.com/books?id=GmqlIibS95IC&pg=PA721&lpg=PA721&dq=John+Affeton+1467&source=bl&ots=whHzN1T59P&sig=JK0PGjYO2QMFN8xcLw9t13hbOcM&hl=en&ei=b2rwTY2cBJGisQPhg_ShDg&sa=X&oi=book_result&ct=result&resnum=3&ved=0CCIQ6AEwA
