2 CONT Sir William was the son of Robert II and Margaret (Peverel) de Ferrers. He married Sybil de Braose.
2 CONT He was a Crusader, and died at the Seige of Acre, Palestine. His body was buried in the Crusader city at Acre. No remains of the graves remain today.
