2 CONC ?through=6000000003714562119 LOUIS associate King of France]''', son of LOUIS VI "le Gros/le Batailleur" King of France & his wife Adélaïde de Maurienne [Savoy] (1120-Paris, Palais Royal de la Cité 18/19 Sep 1180, bur Abbaye ciste
2 CONC rcienne de Notre-Dame-de-Barbeaux near Fontainebleau, transferred 1817 to l'église de l'Abbaye royale de Saint-Denis).  He succeeded his father in 1137 as LOUIS VII "le Jeune/le Pieux" King of France.  He was crowned Duke of Aquit
2 CONC aine, in right of his first wife, 8 Aug 1137 at Bordeaux.  
