2 CONT 3. MUNIO Rodríguez (-[1074/75]). Conde [1030/33]. m firstly (before 1033) JIMENA Ordóñez, daughter of ORDOÑO Vermúdez de León & his wife Fronilde Peláez (-after 18 Sep 1042). ... ... ... m secondly ILDUARA Velásquez, daughter of V
2 CONC ELASCO --- & his wife ---. Munio Rodríguez granted property to his wife Ilduara Velásquez by charter dated 1074[847].
