2 CONT Munio & his second wife had one child:
2 CONT
2 CONT e) '''ELVIRA Muñoz''' . Torres names Elvira Muñoz as daughter of Munio Rodríguez and his second wife and states that she married Pelayo Gómez[866]. m conde PELAYO Gómez de Carrión, son of GÓMEZ Díaz Conde de Saldaña & his wife Ter
2 CONC esa Peláez (-[1101]).
