2 CONT
2 CONT " Counts of Lyon and Forez " , on MedLands  Jean-Luc Fray, " Auvergne, Velay and Kingdom of Arles: elements for a revision of the relational geography Auvergne in the Middle Ages ", Centuries, review of the Center of History Space
2 CONC s and Cultures , Clermont-Ferrand, House of Sciences of Man, Blaise-Pascal University , vol. 15 2002 ( read online )  Bibliography  Document utilisé pour la rédaction de l’article
