1 NAME Mayor /González Salvadórez/
2 GIVN Mayor
2 _MARNM González Salvadórez
1 SEX F
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Not the same as https://www.geni.com/people/D-Mayor-Garc%C3%ADa-de-Aza/6000000013009962681
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fernando_Núñez_de_Lara
2 CONT
2 CONT Fernando was the son of Nuño Pérez de Lara and Teresa Fernández de Traba, who after Nuño's death in 1177 married King Ferdinand II of León, taking her children from her first marriage to live at the court.[3] Sometime before 1202 
2 CONC he married Mayor.[4]
2 CONT
2 CONT Fernando and Mayor had four children:
2 CONT # Fernando (d. before June 1232); 
2 CONT #Álvaro (d. 1240), who married Infanta María Alfonso, illegitimate daughter of Alfonso IX of León and Teresa Gil de Soverosa, and by an unknown mistress fathered Teresa Álvarez, wife of Diego López de Salcedo; 
2 CONT #Sancha, wife of Ferdinand, a younger son of Afonso II of Portugal; and, 
2 CONT #Teresa, who married Count Ponç IV of Empúries.[5]
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SPANISH%20NOBILITY%20LATER%20MEDIEVAL.htm#FernandoNunezdied1217
2 CONT
2 CONT Salazar y Castro records that Nuño Pérez and his wife were both buried in the monastery of Perales[1547].  Nuño & his wife had [six] children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.         '''FERNANDO Núñez de Lara''' (-Marrakesh 1217, bur Santa María de Puente Fitero).   "Condessa dona Maior con mio fijo Alvar Fernandez e con mie fija Sancha Fernandez e con mie fija Taresa Fernandez" donated the church o
2 CONC f Santa María de Esperina, for the soul of "mi marido el conde don Fernando et…mio fijo el Conde de Lara", by charter dated 15 Jun 1232[1556].  
2 CONT
2 CONT Fernando & his wife had [five] children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT *a)         FERNANDO Fernández de Lara (-after 1217). ...
2 CONT * b)         ÁLVARO Fernández de Lara (-after 24 Jul 1240).  Señor de Lara. ...
2 CONT * c)         SANCHA Fernández. ...
2 CONT * d)         [BENITA Fernández ).  Benita is shown in secondary sources as the first wife of Ponce [IV] Conde de Ampurias.  The primary source on which her supposed parentage and marriage are based has not yet been identified.   I
2 CONC t appears unlikely that the information is correct.  ...
2 CONT * e)         TERESA Fernández.   ...
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References 
2 CONT * https://www.geneaordonez.es/datos/getperson.php?personID=I47443&tree=MiArbol Padre	Gonzalo Salvadorez  Madre	Elvira Diaz 
