2 CONT *The Civil History of the Kingdom of Naples: In Two Volumes, Volume 1 By Pietro Giannone Page 629.[https://books.google.com/books?id=MGZUAAAAYAAJ&lpg=PA629&ots=G8ecCQcJEq&dq=Medania%20daughter%20of%20Tancred&pg=PA629#v=onepage&q=M
2 CONC edania%20daughter%20of%20Tancred&f=true GoogleBooks]
