1 CONT
1 CONT     OCCU Count of Nevers&Auxerre..
1 CONT     SOUR COMYN4.TAF says ABT 958; www.public.asu.edu/~bgertz/family/d0000 says ABT 955;
1 CONT     Royalty for Commoners, Roderick W. Stuart, p. 72 says CIR 985/959;
1 CONT     gendex.com/users/daver/rigney/D0001 says 955;
1 CONT     SOUR COMYN4.TAF (Compuserve);
1 CONT     Royalty for Commoners, Roderick W. Stuart, p. 72 says 21 Oct 1026;
1 CONT     gendex.com/users/daver/rigney/D0001 says 21 Sep 1026;
1 CONT     SOUR SAVOY.TXT
1 CONT     Royalty for Commoners, Roderick W. Stuart, p. 72
1 CONT     OTTO WILLIAM, son of ADALBERT I and GERBERGE DE MACON, was Count of Macon and Burgundy; called the Captive, as in his youth he was held a prisoner in England - SAVOY.TXT (Compuserve)
1 CONT     Otton I, King of Lombardy, Count of Burgundy and Macon; - Royalty for Commoners, Roderick W. Stuart, p. 72
1 CONT     SAVOY.TXT gives parents as Adalbert (b. 930 D. AFT 07/968-971), Joint king of Italy) m. CIR 955 Gerberga (d. 990) - NLP
1 CONT     Count of Macon and Burgundy; King of Lombardy - Royalty for Commoners, Roderick W. Stuart, p. 188
1 CONT     Count of Macon & Burgundy, of Lombard, Italy - HAWKINS.GED
1 CONT     Sometimes called Otho William - SAVOY.TXT (Compuserve); COMYN4.TXT says parent
1 CONT     are ROBERT I and Helia de Semur, but this isn't possible - NLP;Othon Guillaume
1 CONT     , Count of Bourgogne - BAIL3.GED (Compuserve), 135; King of Lombardy - Royalty
1 CONT     for Commoners, Roderick W. Stuart, p. 70,213; HAWKINS.GED says parents were
1 CONT     Adalbert, King of Italy & Gerberga de Chalon - NPH
1 CONT
1 CONT Father: King of Italy ADALBERT II b: ABT 936 in Italy
1 CONT Mother: Gerberge DE MACON b: ABT 928 in Bourgogne, France
1 CONT
1 CONT Marriage 1 Ermentrude DE ROUCY b: 958 in Reimes, Macon, France
1 CONT
1 CONT     * Married: ABT 983 in Bourgogne, France 1 2 3 4 5 
1 CONT
1 CONT Children
1 CONT
1 CONT    1. Has Children Mathilde of BURGUNDY b: 965
1 CONT    2. Has Children Gerberge Countess Of BURGUNDY b: 986 in Bourgogne, France
1 CONT    3. Has Children Renaud I Count Palatine Of BURGUNDY b: ABT 990 in Bourgogne, France
1 CONT    4. Has Children Agnes Countess Of BURGUNDY b: 995 in Bourgogne, France
1 CONT
