0 @N6000000003949821347@ NOTE From: Todd A. Farmerie (taf2@po.cwru.edu) Subject: New article on Toulouse, Rouergue, Comminges, and Carcassonne  Newsgroups: soc.genealogy.medieval  Date: 1999/10/25
1 CONT In a chart addressing the Toulouse/Rouergue/Comminges families, several interesting connections are depicted. To start with, Raymond, Count of Pallars and Ribagorza is shown as son of Bernard, Count of Toulouse. While this is one 
1 CONC of the two theories regarding his ancestry, I find it the less likely of the two, with Raymond more likely son of Loup of Bigorre by an unnamed sister of Bernard.
