1 CONT
1 CONT Ramon Berenguer II, byname RAMON BERENGUER THE TOWHEAD, Catalan RAMONBERENGUER CAP D'ESTOPES (b. c. 1053--d. Dec. 5, 1082, betweenBarcelona and Gerona, Catalonia), count of Barcelona who reignedjointly with his twin brother, Beren
1 CONC guer Ramon II, from 1076 to 1082.; "Cabeza le Estopa"
