1 CONC by his brother, thereafter nicknamed "theFratricide" ("el Fratricida"). Berenguer Ramon II, now sole master,took part in the civil wars of the Spanish Muslims and reconquered theTarragona area (1091). He reigned until 1097, when, 
1 CONC having lost atrial by combat that was intended to decide the question of his guiltin the crime attributed to him, he went on crusade to Jerusalem, wherehe died, probably in either 1097 or 1099. [Encyclopaedia Britannica CD'97]
