0 @N6000000002906300636@ NOTE !DESCENT:  Frederick Lewis Weis and Walter Lee Sheppard, Jr., Ancestral Roots
1 CONT of Certain American Colonists Who Came to America Before 1700, 7th ed., at 104
1 CONT (1992).  Line 113A-24.  Grandson of King Garcia III, King of Navarre,
