1 CONC n 1134 Thierry, Count of Flanders; Alice (or Isabell a) (1107-1154, Fontevrault), married William Adelin; after his death i n the White Ship she became a nun and later Abbess of Fontevrault; Eli as II of Maine (died 1151).  His se
