1 CONC ne, inherited all his lands and, first, through her marriage to Louis VII of France, united Aquitaine with the Capetianline and, then, through her marriage to Duke Henry of Normandy (the future Henry II of England) united Aquitain
1 CONC e to the Plantagenet line. [Encyclopaedia Britannica CD '97]
