1 CONT He later becameknown for leading military campaigns that capturedMajorca and otherBalearic Islands, as well as Valencia, from the Moors.
1 CONT
1 CONT Like his Grandfather ascended to the crown at the age of five. It wasrunby a regency until he came of age; and his Uncle Sanc, Count OfProvence,managed the finances and paid off his fathers debts.
