0 @N6000000000337389485@ NOTE Source #1:  T. Anna Leese, "Blood Royal:  Issue of the Kings and Queens of Medieval England, 1066-1399:  The Normans and Plantagenets" (Heritage Books, Inc, 1996), pp. 20-22 - Count of Anjou and Maine and Touraine, Duke of Normand
