1 CONT [BIGOD-Mel Morris,10Gen Anc.FTW]
1 CONT
1 CONT In 1151, Geoffrey of Anjou, who is called Plantagenet because he wears a sprig in his hat, dies and is succeeded by his son, Henry II, who was made Duke of Normandy the year before.
