1 CONT Death
1 CONT
1 CONT By the time of her death she had outlived all of her children except for King John and Queen Leonora.
1 CONT
1 CONT Eleanor died in 1204 and was entombed in Fontevraud Abbey next to her husband Henry and her son Richard. Her tomb effigy shows her reading a Bible and is decorated with magnificent jewelry.
