1 CONT Louis's forces ran amock and burnt the cathedral at Vitry wherein hund reds of women and children had sought shelter.  They were killed.  Lou is feeling responsible took the cross and decided to atone for his si n by making a crus
1 CONC ade.  He cut his hair as a monk and became often ver y somber and always extremely devout.  He went on the second crusade ( Eleanor chose to join him on the journey), and on 20 January 1148 Loui s reached Antalya.  Between the fol
