1 CONC ntreuil, Alice was great-grandmother of Eleanor of Castile, 1st wife of King Edward I of England.
0 @N6000000005598932889@ NOTE Some source indicate that Alice may have been the daughter of Louis an d his third wife Alix de Champagne (?).  Alice, was marked as the futu re wife of Richard then prince of England in 1169 and since that time had been associate
